      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buckskin_Joe"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Curtis Park earned its nickname as Denver’s first streetcar suburb when horse‑drawn cars began running there in 1871.",
